{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"site/index.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T18:51:43.098478Z","id":"c5ef76a0479c1d368498daaf6336521c0d5d57f27bbe447b8ef98c28c2eedcdc","body":{"detail":"Store/share/stats/read-back are pinned in pathbase-goldens (stored@, stats@, ir_back@, losses@) and toolpath's share tests. Resume from Pathbase: scripts/test-quickstart.sh (gate_quickstart; lines 287-318 at f308ab5, 288-319 here) runs path share against a stateful Pathbase stub, then path resume <the shared Pathbase URL> --harness codex --no-cache, which downloads the graph from the stub, writes a new rollout under ~/.codex/sessions with cwd = the resume directory, and execs 'codex resume <its session id>' (a codex stub records argv). The page's own resume line resolves the same way (lines 321-332).","kind":"pass","ref":"git:f308ab5","span":{"start":{"line":142},"end":{"line":143},"content_hash":"020584061edffec370520ed5d3c6a18dbc110b0b46fe7a7a6858155a5fcd405f"},"summary":"Claim: Pathbase stores, shares and resumes sessions — share and resume from a shared Pathbase URL both run end to end — backed","supersedes":"1555fcd2b2ab7e656d62eeccee57e14e2313c3ffbc8a6445c33721f0151684ae","tags":["claim:pathbase-stores-shares-resumes","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
